window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Someone, somewhere, had been strangled. Psychic Jenny Watkins' second vision comes through the eyes of the victim. While she doesn't know when or where the strangulation took place, she does get a good look at the killer. With little else to go on besides an image in her mind, Jenny races to put a name to the face before he strikes again.</p> <p>The sequel to <i>Driven</i>, <i>Betrayed</i> offers an unusual plot, an element of romance and humor throughout.</p>"; 
